ons, and a playground.","source_url":"https://www.fairfaxva.gov/Fun-Facilities/Parks/Parks-Directory/Van-Dyck-Park","source_title":"Van Dyck Park","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":38.8525992,"longitude":-77.2983025,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The park is listed as open daily from dawn to dusk; pavilion reservations and organized uses may carry separate requirements.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gmu-daniels-run-park","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Daniels Run Park","title":"Follow the Wooded Trail Network","subtitle":"Embassy Lane corridor — Daniels Run Park","notes":"Enter from Embassy Lane with daylight to spare, and choose the paved route or an unpaved segment based on conditions.","short_summary":"A wooded 48-acre park provides a trail-focused break east of Old Town.","evidence_claim":"The City of Fairfax identifies Daniels Run Park as a 48-acre park with paved and unpaved trails, benches, picnic tables, and a playground.","source_url":"https://www.fairfaxva.gov/Fun-Facilities/Parks/Parks-Directory/Daniels-Run-Park","source_title":"Daniels Run Park","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":38.8472718,"longitude":-77.2916209,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The park is listed as open daily from dawn to dusk; consult current trail notices and avoid entering after dark.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
